        {"hunk": "h9", "side": "added", "quote": "Across many of our services, you can adjust history and personalization controls to make choices about whether we save some types of data in your Google Account and how we use it to personalize your experience."},
        {"hunk": "h9", "side": "added", "quote": "Saving activity from services like Search, Maps, and Shopping to your Search Services History lets you do things like resume an AI Mode interaction where you left off or see past searches as Autocomplete suggestions."}
