      "text": "A standalone definition block for \"customized search results\" and its associated opt-out instructions were removed, as these concepts are now covered under the updated search personalization sections.",
      "citations": [
        {"hunk": "h12", "side": "removed", "quote": "customized search results"},
        {"hunk": "h12", "side": "removed", "quote": "For example, when you’re signed in to your Google Account and have the Web & App Activity control enabled, you can get more relevant search results that are based on your previous searches and activity from other Google services."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Examples of how the Google app uses stored data were updated to specify that personalized content depends on \"Search Services History\" and the \"Personalized Recommendations in Search services\" setting, replacing the previous reliance on \"Web & App Activity.\"",
      "citations": [
        {"hunk": "h17", "side": "removed", "quote": "if you have searches stored in your Web & App Activity,"},
        {"hunk": "h17", "side": "added", "quote": "if you have searches stored in your Search Services History and have turned on your Personalized Recommendations in Search services setting,"}
